---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Cutting Solutions — KG Robotics";
const description = "Robust cutting robots for pipe rehabilitation and lateral reinstatement.";
const content = "<section class=\"block\"><div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"sep\">/</span><span>Cutting Solutions</span></div>\n    <div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow muted\">Product Family</span><h1>Cutting Solutions</h1><p>Robust, air-powered cutters for milling and lateral reinstatement during pipe rehabilitation.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"family-intro\">\n      <div class=\"family-img\"><img src=\"/images/img-005.jpg\" alt=\"Cutting Solutions\"/></div>\n      <div class=\"copy\"><p>Within the rehabilitation of a sewer pipe (relining), milling and cutting work is required — first to remove elements foreign to the pipe, and afterwards, once the relining is complete, to restore the lateral connections (lateral reinstatement).</p><p>The design philosophy behind our family of cutters prioritizes robustness and simplicity, without giving up power or reliability. The cutting motors are driven by compressed air, which remains the most dependable energy source for this type of system and has done so for many years.</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"product-grid\"><a class=\"card\" href=\"/product/sewercut-100\"><div class=\"ph\"><img src=\"/images/img-011.jpg\" alt=\"SewerCut 100\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><div class=\"card-body\"><div class=\"pname\">SewerCut 100</div><div class=\"ptag\">Air-powered cutter · small diameter</div><p>Robust, simple air-driven cutter for milling obstructions and reinstating laterals in smaller diameter pipes — power and reliability in a compact platform.</p><span class=\"card-link\">View product <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div></a><a class=\"card\" href=\"/product/sewercut-200\"><div class=\"ph\"><img src=\"/images/img-012.jpg\" alt=\"SewerCut 200\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div><div class=\"card-body\"><div class=\"pname\">SewerCut 200</div><div class=\"ptag\">Air-powered cutter · larger diameter</div><p>Higher-capacity air-driven cutter for larger diameters and tougher milling tasks, keeping the same rugged, low-maintenance design language.</p><span class=\"card-link\">View product <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></div></a></div>\n  </div></section>";
const activeFam = "cutting";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} activeFam={activeFam}>
  <Fragment set:html={content} />
</BaseLayout>
